            <ArticleTitle>Thigh abscess as a complication of continuous popliteal sciatic nerve block.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>255-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case report of severe localized infection after continuous popliteal sciatic nerve block. The report highlights the importance of meticulous asepsis and possibly limiting the duration of catheter use.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
